'' RUN: a shared, a shared array and a static UDT, each initialised from a tuple that fills a
'' 'string * N' field. The aggregate folder refused a 'string * N' leaf because fbc-modern refuses
'' the shape (error 7), while tiko already took the LOCAL form -- so the shared one stopped on
'' TKO0994 (Rosetta Four_is_magic; fbc-examples repro ice23). Supported now by the author's
'' decision (2026-10-20): space-padded and truncated as a 'string * N' is, and the folded image is
'' not then refilled by the implicit constructor at start-up.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/shared-udt-fixstr-init.bas -o tests/codegen/sharedudtfixstrinit.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-NOT: TKO0994
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/codegen/sharedudtfixstrinit.exe
'' RUN: tests/codegen/sharedudtfixstrinit.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: [trillion][billion ][thousand] 1000000000
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: [ab      ] 5
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: [static  ] 7
